# Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values

# ============================================
# Google Analytics Configuration
# ============================================
# Google Analytics Measurement ID
# Format: G-XXXXXXXXXX
# Get from: Google Analytics Dashboard → Admin → Data Streams → Web Stream → Measurement ID
# 
# Default: G-7NNNN03VPV (will be used if not set)
# To use a different GA ID, set: NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# To disable Google Analytics, leave empty: NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
# 
# 默认值：G-7NNNN03VPV（如果未设置将使用此值）
# 要使用不同的 GA ID，设置：NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# 要禁用 Google Analytics，留空：NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-7NNNN03VPV

# ============================================
# Notes
# ============================================
# 1. Never commit .env.local to Git (it's in .gitignore)
# 2. Only commit env.example as a template
# 3. The app will use G-7NNNN03VPV as default if NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID is not set

